WEBVTT

00:04:00.703 --> 00:04:04.523
Until I got to know the subject
they gave me to teach.

00:04:04.523 --> 00:04:06.784
(Laughter)

00:04:07.994 --> 00:04:10.473
Yes, it was math.

00:04:10.473 --> 00:04:11.683
(Laughter)

00:04:13.313 --> 00:04:19.702
And I'm like, "Oh God, how will I teach
something I hate so much?"

00:04:19.702 --> 00:04:21.064
(Laughter)

00:04:22.094 --> 00:04:24.568
But I had no choice

00:04:25.378 --> 00:04:27.998
so I started teaching math.

00:04:28.698 --> 00:04:31.654
You know, the basics
like multiplication tables.